{"id":"n88141-1-9","stage":4,"title":"회수 · 回收","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88141-1-9-1","ko":"혹시 이 책 대출 중인가요?","zh":"这本书现在在借出中吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"책","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}},{"text":"대출","meaning":"借贷","explanation":"대출：借贷","readings":[{"term":"대출","audio":"/audio/91cf9cdc7358e6cc6d54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14359","senseId":"1","lemma":"대출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대출","audio":"/audio/91cf9cdc7358e6cc6d54.mp3"}},{"text":"중인가요?","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중인가요","audio":"/audio/d99d855b31e19f0190d8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"91cf9cdc7358e6cc","term":"대출","zh":"借贷","audio":"/audio/91cf9cdc7358e6cc6d54.mp3","entryId":"14359","definition":"对金钱或物品借进贷出。","pronunciation":["대ː출"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"的时候","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"在做某事的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3a925423dbdbb2e4a1e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88141-1-9-2","ko":"네. 아직 회수가 되지 않았습니다.","zh":"是的，还没被收回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"회수가","meaning":"回收，收回，赎回，索回，追回","explanation":"회수：回收，收回，赎回，索回，追回；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"회수","audio":"/audio/8b179161385c2bb6deec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88141","senseId":"1","lemma":"회수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회수가","audio":"/audio/cd75aeeae8bc536faa1f.mp3"}},{"text":"되지","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되지","audio":"/audio/507870f39c91f2c2ef24.mp3"}},{"text":"않았습니다.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았습니다","audio":"/audio/d44e6eea3da61d729d00.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"8b179161385c2bb6","term":"회수","zh":"回收，收回，赎回，索回，追回","audio":"/audio/8b179161385c2bb6deec.mp3","entryId":"88141","definition":"出让或借出去的东西又收回来。","pronunciation":["회수","훼수"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7642128a17873aedf4ac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88141","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，还没被收回来。","是要在手臂上打针吗？","这本书现在在借出中吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，还没被收回来。","这本书现在在借出中吗？","是要在手臂上打针吗？"],"answer":0}]}
